1
00:04:24,444 --> 00:04:30,444
Of all the abductions, this one is different.

2
00:08:48,888 --> 00:08:54,888
Bugonia is a science fiction, thriller, crime film directed by Yorgos Lanthimos.

3
00:13:13,333 --> 00:13:19,333
Two conspiracy obsessed young men kidnap the high-powered CEO of a major company,
convinced that she is an alien intent on destroying planet Earth.

4
00:17:37,777 --> 00:17:43,777
Michelle, played by Emma Stone.

5
00:22:02,222 --> 00:22:08,222
Teddy, played by Jesse Plemons.

6
00:26:26,666 --> 00:26:32,666
Don, played by Aidan Delbis.

7
00:30:51,111 --> 00:30:57,111
Casey, played by Stavros Halkias.

8
00:35:15,555 --> 00:35:21,555
Sandy, played by Alicia Silverstone.

9
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:46,000
Ricky / Security Guard, played by J. Carmen Galindez Barrera.

10
00:44:04,444 --> 00:44:10,444
Bugonia is a 2025 black comedy film directed by Yorgos
Lanthimos and written by Will Tracy.

11
00:48:28,888 --> 00:48:34,888
An English-language remake of the 2003 South Korean film Save the Green Planet!

12
00:52:53,333 --> 00:52:59,333
by Jang Joon-hwan, Bugonia follows two young men who kidnap a powerful CEO,
suspecting that she is secretly an alien who wants to destroy Earth.

13
00:57:17,777 --> 00:57:23,777
A co-production of the United Kingdom, Ireland, South Korea, and the United States, the film stars
Emma Stone, Jesse Plemons, Aidan Delbis, Stavros Halkias, and Alicia Silverstone.

14
01:01:42,222 --> 01:01:48,222
Development on the film began in 2020, with Jang attached to direct, Will Tracy
adapting the screenplay, and Ari Aster boarding as producer.

15
01:06:06,666 --> 01:06:12,666
Jang later stepped down as director, citing health concerns,
but remained attached as an executive producer.

16
01:10:31,111 --> 01:10:37,111
By February 2024, Lanthimos was hired to direct in Jang's place, while
Stone joined the project both as an actress and producer.

17
01:14:55,555 --> 01:15:01,555
Plemons joined the cast that May, and it was soon acquired by Focus
Features for distribution at the Cannes Film Festival.

18
01:19:20,000 --> 01:19:26,000
Principal photography began in July in High Wycombe, England, and Atlanta,
Georgia, and during which time, the rest of the cast was announced.

19
01:23:44,444 --> 01:23:50,444
Additional filming took place in May 2025 in Milos, Greece.

20
01:28:08,888 --> 01:28:14,888
With an estimated budget of $45–$55 million, Bugonia
is Lanthimos's most expensive film.

21
01:32:33,333 --> 01:32:39,333
Bugonia premiered in the main competition of the 82nd Venice International Film Festival on August 28,
2025, and was theatrically released in the United States by Focus Features on October 24.

22
01:36:57,777 --> 01:37:03,777
It received generally positive reviews from critics, with the
performances of Stone and Plemons receiving praise.

23
01:41:22,222 --> 01:41:28,222
Both received nominations for their performances at the 83rd
Golden Globe Awards and the 32nd Actor Awards.

24
01:45:46,666 --> 01:45:52,666
At the 98th Academy Awards, the film received four nominations
including Best Picture and Best Actress for Stone.

25
01:50:11,111 --> 01:50:17,111
The film explores themes of saving the world,
capitalism, kidnapping, paranoia, delusion.

26
01:54:35,555 --> 01:54:41,555
The tone is dark and thought_provoking and intense.
